| Gap reversal | 1,684 | 14.54 | 70.58% | +0.01359 | +0.04237 | 0.3154 | **Failed ICIR gate** |
| DXY-residualized momentum | 1,537 | 10.82 | — | −0.00561 | −0.01511 | — | **Failed both gates** |

The binding admission thresholds are absolute daily IC ≥ **0.0070** and absolute daily ICIR ≥ **0.0840**.

Additional diagnostics:

- **CLV-residualized intraday reversal**
  - Regime IC / ICIR:
    - 2020–2022: +0.01029 / +0.02701
