Both candidates failed the benchmark admission gates of absolute IC ≥ 0.0070 and absolute ICIR ≥ 0.0840. The trend-quality factor was particularly adverse in the recent regime, while defensive quality showed no meaningful predictive power and deteriorated in 2028 onward.

