### Explored Factors

#### Volatility-scaled smoothed candle-pressure reversal

Construction:

\[
\text{Signal}_t =
\operatorname{CSdemean}
\left[
-\operatorname{shift}_1
\left(
\frac{
\operatorname{mean}_3[(C-O)/(H-L)]
}{
\sigma_{20}
}
\right)
\right]
\]

The factor measures the signed close-to-open move relative to the daily high-low range, smooths the measure over three completed sessions, scales it by 20-session realized volatility, reverses the signal, and lags it by one session to avoid look-ahead bias.

